{
  "Description": "CR-25 (blob and container soft delete) fixtures, synthetic names and IDs. Arg is the storage account list of the DP.1-CONTAINERS query and Vaults the Recovery Services vault list, as Resource Graph returns them. Arm holds each GET the STORAGE-CONTAINERS engine makes, keyed by account or vault name and path, with a string standing for the error the request throws. Rows is DP.1-SOFTDELETE as collector 1.20.0 writes it from them: stbothoff with both settings off and no lifecycle policy (404), stcontaineron with container soft delete already on for 14 days and three lifecycle rules (one tiering, one deleting, one disabled), stblobon with blob soft delete already on for 30 days, stallon with both on, stlake a hierarchical namespace account with both off and a deleting rule, stsrcache01 the cache storage account a Recovery Services vault names for Azure to Azure replication, stdrcacheasrcache named like a Site Recovery cache account but named by no vault, stclientlogs a Blob storage account for -SoftDeleteExclude, stdenied whose read was refused and stpremfiles a FileStorage account.",
